<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 10,843 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 10,843 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico placed the first two of three credits whereby it sought to inject 10.843 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were placed or offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    2.421 bln  4 days    27.58 pct</p>
<p>    2.422 bln  3 days    27.52 pct</p>
<p>6.000 bln  1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
